@startuml
title Copy, replay, and cutover timeline

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #315B7D
  LifeLineBorderColor #315B7D
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F7F9FB
  ParticipantBorderColor #315B7D
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F1FA
}

participant "Source G0" as G0
participant "CDC stream" as CDC
participant "Shadow G1" as G1
participant "Catalog / routing" as CAT

G0 -> CDC : arm retention before snapshot
G0 -> G1 : snapshot / clone state at S
note over G0,G1
  commit_ht <= S is represented by the copy
end note

G0 -> CDC : user INSERT / UPDATE / DELETE after S
CDC -> G1 : logical replay (S, F]
note over CDC,G1
  Replay must cover every transaction
  committed through final barrier F.
end note

== Current prototype ==
CAT -> CAT : choose F before replay drain
G0 -> CDC : writes can still commit after F
CDC -> G1 : drain only through F
CAT -> CAT : master role flip
CAT -> CAT : later manual relfilenode finalize
note over G0,G1 #FFDDDD
  Unsafe tail: writes committed after F and before finalize.
  External quiescing is required today.
end note

== Target ==
CAT -> G0 : acquire distributed write fence
CAT -> CAT : choose F after in-flight writers drain
CDC -> G1 : drain final tiny tail through F
CAT -> CAT : atomic generation + catalog switch K
CAT -> G0 : release write fence
@enduml
